rem Staff/admin-port settings (optional). Copy to .staff.env on the ops machine.
rem Loaded ONLY by reboot_tkp_staff / reboot_tcp_staff / reboot_mp_staff.
rem The launchers force TEARSHEET_MODE=staff and the staff ports AFTER this
rem file loads, so mode/ports cannot be set here.
rem
rem Staff requests are only honored when the Host header is loopback OR listed
rem here (comma-separated). Add the Cloudflare admin tunnel hostnames when
rem wiring public access — protect them with Cloudflare Access first.
set "TEARSHEET_STAFF_ALLOWED_HOSTS=tkp-admin.hcresearch.ltd,tcp-admin.hcresearch.ltd,agm-admin.hcresearch.ltd"
